flowchart TD
    S[Perception and sensors] --> N[Neural learning and grounding]
    N --> G[Explicit symbolic representation]
    G --> R[Reasoning, planning, and constraints]
    R --> E[Execution and skills]
    E --> M[Monitoring and assurance]
    M -->|feedback and re-planning| R
    M -->|perception cueing| S
    R -->|learning signals or structural priors| N

    H[Human oversight] --- M
    C[Edge and cloud resources] --- N
    C --- R
    O[Other UAVs / heterogeneous agents] --- E

    classDef neural fill:#eef,stroke:#446;
    classDef symbolic fill:#efe,stroke:#464;
    classDef system fill:#f6f6f6,stroke:#777;
    class N neural;
    class G,R symbolic;
    class S,E,M,H,C,O system;

    subgraph Legend["Proposed framework"]
      L1[Neural component]
      L2[Symbolic component]
      L3[System/context]
    end
